# pi runtime state & secrets — never commit.
# Because ~/.pi is a stow tree-folded symlink into this repo, pi writes its
# runtime files here; keep them out of version control.
# auth.json holds the Fireworks API key + Claude OAuth token — must stay ignored.
# agents/ holds subagent role definitions (config) — tracked on purpose.
auth.json
trust.json
sessions/
npm/
git/
mcp-cache.json
mcp-npx-cache.json
